onte Carlo.","fr":"Une invitée raconte être passée par Marseille en allant à Monte-Carlo.","es":"Una invitada cuenta que pasó por Marsella camino de Montecarlo."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"mediterranean","collection":"cited","name":"Mediterranean Sea","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"184609dfa3d810b575deea94cb4bea9cf16855025e691b4fe8dac1280572607e","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The late afternoon sky is compared to the blue of the Mediterranean.","it":"Il cielo del tardo pomeriggio è paragonato all’azzurro del Mediterraneo.","fr":"Le ciel de fin d’après-midi est comparé au bleu de la Méditerranée.","es":"El cielo de última hora de la tarde se compara con el azul del Mediterráneo."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"memphis","collection":"cited","name":"Memphis","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"dacd13e91e5c46854654b5f11d36a537216364e01247badd53c17d3f348ef20f","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Nick mentions knowing a man called Bill Biloxi from Memphis.","it":"Nick dice di aver conosciuto un uomo di Memphis chiamato Bill Biloxi.","fr":"Nick dit avoir connu un homme de Memphis nommé Bill Biloxi.","es":"Nick dice haber conocido a un hombre de Memphis llamado Bill Biloxi."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"merton","collection":"cited","name":"Merton College · architectural allusion","noteHash":"404b44f290197f1651fcbbf62644da93","positionSource":"7ff710f693eff0bd257178b488c344b0b0346ccc618949c1f9e4ffe995d2acf5","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Gatsby’s library is described with an allusion to Merton College.","it":"La biblioteca di Gatsby è descritta con un’allusione al Merton College.","fr":"La bibliothèque de Gatsby est décrite par une allusion à Merton College.","es":"La biblioteca de Gatsby se describe con una alusión a Merton College."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"minnesota","collection":"cited","name":"Minnesota","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"d83cb7ff790a00065263aa39c205333524058ecf2bcf06979eb2cb6e84858e76","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"James Gatz spends two unhappy weeks at St. Olaf’s in southern Minnesota.","it":"James Gatz trascorre due settimane infelici allo St. Olaf’s nel Minnesota meridionale.","fr":"James Gatz passe deux semaines malheureuses à St. Olaf’s dans le sud du Minnesota.","es":"James Gatz pasa dos semanas infelices en St. Olaf’s, al sur de Minnesota."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"montana","collection":"cited","name":"Montana","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"15b3ec244be5e10b5528a33d70c72b234b9f5acae703123d88ea0f28ffdb0ee5","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Dan Cody’s dealings in Montana copper made him a millionaire many times over.","it":"Gli affari di Dan Cody nel rame del Montana lo resero più volte milionario.","fr":"Les affaires de Dan Cody dans le cuivre du Montana le rendirent plusieurs fois millionnaire.","es":"Los negocios de Dan Cody con el cobre de Montana lo hicieron millonario muchas veces."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"montauk","collection":"cited","name":"Montauk Point","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"a7837ce1b697e672d0c250ad34faaeaf729d08f38b42210e14581b96caa8ec3c","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Two paintings mentioned in the novel take Montauk Point as their subject.","it":"Due dipinti nominati nel romanzo hanno Montauk Point come soggetto.","fr":"Deux tableaux mentionnés dans le roman prennent Montauk Point pour sujet.","es":"Dos cuadros mencionados en la novela tienen Montauk Point como tema."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"montecarlo","collection":"cited","name":"Monte Carlo","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"d4e4a2971e28ee7d07bee4f3e84111f28ce7a41ff04fdc73c3d632570b6d61a1","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"A guest tells the company she has just returned from Monte Carlo.","it":"Un’invitata racconta alla compagnia di essere appena tornata da Monte Carlo.","fr":"Une invitée raconte à la compagnie qu’elle revient de Monte-Carlo.","es":"Una invitada cuenta al grupo que acaba de regresar de Montecarlo."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"montenegro","collection":"cited","name":"Montenegro","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"96fb39cab38302128e389118267d5ab9fca0800f3409bba65c738bb8d2c00bbd","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Gatsby shows Nick a decoration that he says came from Montenegro.","it":"Gatsby mostra a Nick una decorazione che dice di aver ricevuto dal Montenegro.","fr":"Gatsby montre à Nick une décoration qu’il dit avoir reçue du Monténégro.","es":"Gatsby muestra a Nick una condecoración que dice haber recibido de Montenegro."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"nevada","collection":"cited","name":"Nevada","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"d02bf72c7259c48868c52c110347867fa4b616be8fb398517a9970963e9a918d","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Nevada’s silver fields are part of Dan Cody’s history of mining ventures.","it":"I giacimenti d’argento del Nevada fanno parte della storia degli affari minerari di Dan Cody.","fr":"Les champs d’argent du Nevada font partie de l’histoire des entreprises minières de Dan Cody.","es":"Los yacimientos de plata de Nevada forman parte de la historia de los negocios mineros de Dan Cody."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"newhaven","collection":"cited","name":"New Haven","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"532b7bb4dbbf696998ef2cefb2035b26684fdff88df79fe9237dffd1f3d98bd6","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Nick recalls graduating at New Haven in 1915, following his father’s path.","it":"Nick ricorda di essersi laureato a New Haven nel 1915, seguendo il percorso del padre.","fr":"Nick se souvient avoir obtenu son diplôme à New Haven en 1915, suivant la voie de son père.","es":"Nick recuerda haberse graduado en New Haven en 1915, siguiendo el camino de su padre."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"newjersey","collection":"cited","name":"New Jersey","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"17c41b5f35d5011ad5ed6bf14348485e2c8e1c6b780c1bfa0a395b185c00792a","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Miss Baedeker remembers nearly drowning in a pool in New Jersey.","it":"Miss Baedeker ricorda di aver rischiato di annegare in una piscina nel New Jersey.","fr":"Miss Baedeker se souvient avoir failli se noyer dans une piscine du New Jersey.","es":"Miss Baedeker recuerda haber estado a punto de ahogarse en una piscina de Nueva Jersey."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"neworleans","collection":"cited","name":"New Orleans","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"bf84161258d236b4819695e83f138c1dbd0126a406816da8337a8a4e45b548e8","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Jordan recalls a man from New Orleans whom Daisy was reportedly engaged to before marrying Tom.","it":"Jordan ricorda un uomo di New Orleans con cui si diceva che Daisy fosse fidanzata prima di sposare Tom.","fr":"Jordan évoque un homme de La Nouvelle-Orléans auquel Daisy aurait été fiancée avant d’épouser Tom.","es":"Jordan recuerda a un hombre de Nueva Orleans con quien se decía que Daisy estaba prometida antes de casarse con Tom."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"ohio","collection":"cited","name":"Ohio River","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"a51ef9dd36b418df108f891a59ff9048b2be4c4416e58863585b974c20c43046","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Nick contrasts the eastern world with the towns beyond the Ohio River.","it":"Nick contrappone il mondo dell’Est alle città al di là del fiume Ohio.","fr":"Nick oppose le monde de l’Est aux villes situées au-delà de l’Ohio.","es":"Nick contrapone el mundo del Este a las ciudades situadas más allá del río Ohio."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"oxford","collection":"cited","name":"Oxford","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"2f7f29898dd7fffd1357a4072b7fd44bb13240c2b47c4db4ddcc80522265963b","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Jordan says Gatsby once told her he was an Oxford man.","it":"Jordan racconta che Gatsby le disse una volta di essere stato a Oxford.","fr":"Jordan raconte que Gatsby lui a dit un jour avoir étudié à Oxford.","es":"Jordan cuenta que Gatsby le dijo una vez que había estudiado en Oxford."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"southampton","collection":"cited","name":"Southampton · Long Island","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"eb95b39260b967f032515162669865051a8dcd1c9915f46d689b0319cb6979f6","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Jordan tells Nick she is leaving Hempstead for Southampton on Long Island.","it":"Jordan dice a Nick di lasciare Hempstead per Southampton, a Long Island.","fr":"Jordan dit à Nick qu’elle quitte Hempstead pour Southampton, à Long Island.","es":"Jordan dice a Nick que sale de Hempstead hacia Southampton, en Long Island."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"street43","collection":"cited","name":"43rd Street","noteHash":"5948cb53f0572c75e7a6720a943db664","positionSource":"6687724d5cea3eb5f4645b14b118b6a340df8059b60e19861c523bbe9f3046bc","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Wolfshiem recalls first meeting Gatsby at a poolroom on 43rd Street.","it":"Wolfshiem ricorda di aver incontrato Gatsby per la prima volta in una sala da biliardo sulla 43rd Street.","fr":"Wolfshiem se souvient avoir rencontré Gatsby pour la première fois dans une salle de billard de la 43e Rue.","es":"Wolfshiem recuerda haber conocido a Gatsby en un salón de billar de la calle 43."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"street50","collection":"cited","name":"50th Street","noteHash":"5948cb53f0572c75e7a6720a943db664","positionSource":"84f859bae5bc405a3932f42437eb59b1c057928285e11291c912954b3e53c9f8","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Jordan suggests the large cinemas around 50th Street as a cool refuge on a hot day.","it":"Jordan suggerisce i grandi cinema intorno alla 50th Street come rifugio fresco in una giornata calda.","fr":"Jordan suggère les grands cinémas autour de la 50e Rue comme refuge frais par une chaude journée.","es":"Jordan propone los grandes cines cerca de la calle 50 como refugio fresco en un día caluroso."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"versailles","collection":"cited","name":"Versailles","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"0f6f7f5a4c7a288a23971bacd95accc14d4dbf9d542c1861b46a74c86aacc695","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Scenes of the gardens of Versailles appear on the furniture in Myrtle’s apartment.","it":"Scene dei giardini di Versailles compaiono sul rivestimento dei mobili nell’appartamento di Myrtle.","fr":"Des scènes des jardins de Versailles apparaissent sur les meubles de l’appartement de Myrtle.","es":"Escenas de los jardines de Versalles aparecen en los muebles del apartamento de Myrtle."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"washington","collection":"cited","name":"Washington, D.C.","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"7f735b3ac6761d7e7810af49250d31b213be761010ab62d9e0dddcc10aaa4329","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Nick’s prospective housemate is sent to Washington before they can share a house.","it":"Il futuro coinquilino di Nick viene mandato a Washington prima che possano condividere una casa.","fr":"Le futur colocataire de Nick est envoyé à Washington avant qu’ils puissent partager une maison.","es":"El futuro compañero de casa de Nick es enviado a Washington antes de que puedan compartir vivienda."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"yukon","collection":"cited","name":"Yukon","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"42e90fbc64106999621ec327b064c0dc69e9dc657f428dcd0850747c86387fbd","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The Yukon is listed among the mining rushes that shaped Dan Cody’s career.","it":"Lo Yukon è elencato fra le corse minerarie che segnarono la carriera di Dan Cody.","fr":"Le Yukon figure parmi les ruées minières qui ont marqué la carrière de Dan Cody.","es":"El Yukón figura entre las fiebres mineras que marcaron la carrera de Dan Cody."}}}]'::jsonb; expected integer := 28;
begin
 if (select count(*) from public.place_descriptions d join jsonb_to_recordset(p) x(book text,id text,collection text,"noteHash" text,"positionSource" text,"narrativeSource" text,description jsonb) on d.book_id=x.book and d.place_id=x.id and d.collection=x.collection where md5(coalesce(d.note,''))=x."noteHash" and d.position_source_id::text=x."positionSource" and d.narrative_source_id::text is not distinct from x."narrativeSource" and (not (coalesce(d.metadata,'{}'::jsonb) ? 'positionDescription') or d.metadata->'positionDescription'=x.description)) <> expected then raise exception 'A source or summary changed; no updates applied'; end if;
 update public.place_descriptions d set metadata=jsonb_set(coalesce(d.metadata,'{}'::jsonb),'{positionDescription}',x.description,true) from jsonb_to_recordset(p) x(book text,id text,collection text,description jsonb) where d.book_id=x.book and d.place_id=x.id and d.collection=x.collection;
end $revision$;
commit;
